# Flagged migration output held back from the PUBLISHED site.
#
# migrate.py routes recipes that need human review into content/_needs_review/.
# These files ARE committed (the durable review queue) but must NOT be built,
# deployed, or indexed by Pagefind until a human reviews one and MOVES it into
# content/recipes/ (clearing `review: true`). Listing the directory here tells
# Eleventy to skip it during the build, so it never appears in _site/.
#
# The auto-discovery contract for content/recipes/ is untouched: any .md dropped
# there still becomes a page with zero config edits.
content/_needs_review
